{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121936","id":4169670668,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74iCAM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121936","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121936.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121936.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121936","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121936/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121936/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121936/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe761741c7b5e68336f5d835ad452ae3a6f02f33","number":121936,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add core level `WeakRef` to make weak `Object` references easier and safer. Fix a few potential `EditorInspector` crashes.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Follow-up to/includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112470\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122016\r\n\r\nThere is currently no core endorsed way to hold a weak reference to an object.\r\nHowever, this is often critical for the editor; basically anytime you hold a reference to a non-RefCounted object you don't own, you need a weak reference.\r\n\r\nThe [`Object` ownership guide](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/architecture/object_class.html#object-ownership-and-casting) currently awkwardly suggests storing an `ObjectID` which isn't very convenient.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI opted against storing `T *` for fast access (which `CoreBind::WeakRef` and `Variant` do) because it's inherently unsafe. Those two storing `T *` directly is probably directly causing (rare) crashes.\r\n\r\nI also fixed a potential crashes in `EditorInspector` to demonstrate the need and how to use it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX"